Recommends: unitotem-viewer, alsa-utils
Description: Kiosk scheduler and web management interface
 UniTotem plays playlists of images, videos, PDF documents and web pages on
 one or more screens, and is managed through a web interface served over HTTPS:
 uploads, scheduling, displays, audio, network, users, timers, backups and
 remote control of other nodes.
 .
 This package contains the scheduler, the API and the web interface. It runs
 on its own as a headless server; the local viewer window is in
 unitotem-viewer.

Package: unitotem-viewer
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${python3:Depends},
         python3-cefpython3,
         python3-pyside6.qtcore,
         python3-pyside6.qtgui,
         python3-pyside6.qtwidgets,
         unitotem-manager (= ${source:Version}),
         x11-xserver-utils,
         xserver-xorg-core,
Description: Fullscreen viewer window for UniTotem
 One frameless fullscreen browser window per connected screen, driven by the
 UniTotem scheduler. Windows follow the screens as they are plugged and
 unplugged.

Package: python3-cefpython3
Architecture: any
Section: python
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3 (<< 3.14), python3 (>= 3.13)
Description: Python bindings for the Chromium Embedded Framework
 CEF 147 built with proprietary codecs (H.264, AAC) and the Python bindings
 of the cefpython fork used by UniTotem.
 .
 This package repackages a binary build of the upstream project; it is meant
 for the UniTotem repository and is not suitable for the Debian archive.

